hadiths[18]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1838","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Quraish ke mushrik Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se taqdeer mein jhagarnay aaye. To naazil hui: Jis din wo aag mein apne chehron par ghaseetay jayein ge, Saqar ki chhuan chakho. Beshak ham ne har cheez taqdeer se paida ki. (Muslim: 8/52). Baab: Har cheez taqdeer se hai yahan tak ke aajizi aur aqalmandi."
"1839","[AI-translation] Taus se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba mein se kuch logon ko paya jo kehtay thay ke har cheez taqdeer se hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur main ne Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ko kehtay hue suna: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Har cheez taqdeer se hai yahan tak ke aajizi aur aqalmandi, ya aqalmandi aur aajizi. (Muslim: 8/51-52). Baab: Taqat ka hukm aur aajizi chhorna."
"1840","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Taqatwar momin Allah ke nazdeek kamzor momin se behtar aur zyada pasandeeda hai, aur har aik mein khair hai. Us par hirs karo jo tumhein faida de, Allah se madad mango aur aajiz na bano. Aur agar tumhein koi cheez pahunchay to na kaho ke agar main aisa karta to aisa aisa hota, lekin kaho ke Allah ki taqdeer hai aur jo Us ne chaha Us ne kiya. Beshak agar magar shaitaan ke amal ka darwaza kholta hai. (Muslim: 8/56). Baab: Makhlooq se pehle taqdeerein likhna."
"1841","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Allah ne makhlooq ki taqdeerein aasmanon aur zameen ko paida karnay se pachaas hazaar saal pehle likhin. Aap ne farmaya: Aur Us ka arsh pani par tha. (Muslim: 8/51). Baab: Taqdeer ka saboot, aur Adam aur Musa (alaihimussalam) ka bahas karna."
"1842","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Adam aur Musa (alaihimussalam) ne apne Rab ke paas bahas ki to Adam (alaihissalam) Musa (alaihissalam) par ghalib aaye. Musa (alaihissalam) ne kaha ke tum wohi Adam ho jin ko Allah Taala ne apne haath se banaya, apni rooh tum mein phoonki aur tumhein farishton se sajda karaya, aur tumhein apni jannat mein rehnay ko jagah di, phir tum ne apni khata ki wajah se logon ko zameen par utar diya. Adam (alaihissalam) ne kaha ke tum wo Musa ho jin ko Allah Taala ne apna paighambar kar ke aur kalaam kar ke chun liya aur tumhein Allah Taala ne Tauraat ki takhtiyan din jin mein har baat ka bayan hai aur tumhein sarghoshi ke liye apne qareeb kiya, aur tum kya samajhtay ho ke Allah Taala ne Tauraat ko mere paida honay se kitni muddat pehle likha hai? Musa (alaihissalam) ne kaha ke chaalees baras. Adam (alaihissalam) ne kaha ke kya tum ne Tauraat mein nahi padha ke Adam ne apne Rab ke farman ke khilaf kiya aur bhatak gaya? Musa (alaihissalam) ne kaha ke kyun nahi, main ne padha hai. Adam (alaihissalam) ne kaha ke phir tum mujhe us kaam ke karnay par malamat kartay ho jo Allah ne meri taqdeer mein mere paida honay se chaalees baras pehle likh diya tha? Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke pas Adam (alaihissalam) Musa (alaihissalam) par ghalib aa gaye. (Muslim). (Asal tahajja tha, Muslim ki doosri riwayat mein hai.)"
"1843","[AI-translation] Abul Aswad Daili se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Batao, jo log aaj amal kartay hain aur us mein mehnat kartay hain, kya wo cheez hai jo un par faisla ki gayi aur un par guzri hui taqdeer mein se hai, ya us mein jo wo mustaqbil mein payein ge jo un ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas laye aur un par hujjat sabit hui? To main ne kaha: Balke wo cheez hai jo un par faisla ki gayi aur un par guzri. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne kaha: Kya wo zulm na hoga? Unhon ne kaha: To main us se sakht ghabraya aur kaha: Har cheez Allah ki makhlooq aur Us ke haath ki milkiyat hai. Us se us ke kiye ke baaray mein poocha nahi jata aur un se poocha jata hai. To unhon ne mujh se kaha: Allah tum par rehem karay, main ne tum se jo poocha us se mera irada sirf tumhari aqal aazmana tha. Beshak Mazina ke do mard Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Bataiye, jo log aaj amal kartay hain aur us mein mehnat kartay hain, kya wo cheez hai jo un par faisla ki gayi aur un mein guzri hui taqdeer mein se hai, ya us mein jo wo mustaqbil mein payein ge jo un ke Nabi un ke paas laye aur un par hujjat sabit hui? To Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, balke wo cheez hai jo un par faisla ki gayi aur un mein guzri. Aur us ki tasdeeq Allah ki kitab mein hai: Qasam hai nafs ki aur us ki jis ne usay barabar kiya, phir usay us ki badkaari aur us ki parhezgari samjhayi. (Muslim: 8/48-49). Baab: Taqdeer aur badbakhti aur khushbakhti ke baaray mein."
"1844","[AI-translation] Ali (karramallahu wajhahu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Baqi-ul-Gharqad mein janazay mein thay. To hamaray paas Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aaye aur baithay, ham Aap ke gird baithay, aur Aap ke saath choti laathi thi. To Aap ne sar jhukaya aur apni laathi se zameen kureednay lagay, phir farmaya: Tum mein se koi nahi, koi jaandar jaan nahi magar Allah ne jannat aur aag mein us ki jagah likh di hai, aur siwae is ke ke wo badbakht ya khushbakht likhi gayi hai. Unhon ne kaha: To aik mard ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kya ham apni kitab par thehar kar amal chhor na dein? To Aap ne farmaya: Jo khushbakhton mein se hoga wo jald khushbakhton ke amal ki taraf aaye ga, aur jo badbakhton mein se hoga wo jald badbakhton ke amal ki taraf aaye ga. To Aap ne farmaya: Amal karo, har aik ke liye aasan kiya gaya hai. Raha khushbakht to un ke liye khushbakhton ke amal aasan kiye jatay hain, aur raha badbakht to un ke liye badbakhton ke amal aasan kiye jatay hain. Phir Aap ne padha: Raha jis ne diya aur taqwa ikhtiyar kiya, aur achai ki tasdeeq ki, to ham usay aasani ke liye aasan karein ge. Aur raha jis ne bakhli ki aur beparwa hua, aur achai ko jhutlaya, to ham usay tangi ke liye aasan karein ge. (Muslim: 8/46-47). (Muslim mein qad nahi hai; mikhsara wo hai jo insan haath mein le aur choti laathi ko chota karay.)"
"1845","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak aadmi lambi muddat jannatiyon ke amal karta hai, phir us ka amal dozakhiyon ke amal par khatm hota hai. Aur beshak aadmi lambi muddat dozakhiyon ke amal karta hai, phir us ka amal jannatiyon ke amal par khatm hota hai. (Muslim: 8/49). Baab: Muddatein muqarrar aur rizq taqseem karnay ke baaray mein."
"1846","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umm Habiba ne kaha: Ae Allah! Mujhe mere shohar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), mere walid Abu Sufyan aur mere bhai Muawiya se faida de. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Beshak tum ne Allah se muqarrar muddaton, chali hui nishaniyon aur taqseem shuda rizqon ke liye manga hai. Wo us mein se koi cheez us ke waqt se pehle jaldi nahi karay ga aur na us mein se koi cheez us ke waqt ke baad muakkhar karay ga. Aur agar tum Allah se mangtin ke wo tumhein aag ke azaab aur qabr ke azaab se aafiyat de to tumharay liye behtar hota. Unhon ne kaha: To aik mard ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Bandar aur khinzeer kya maskh shuda mein se hain? To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne kisi qaum ko halak ya azaab nahi kiya to un ke liye nasal banayi. Aur beshak bandar aur khinzeer us se pehle thay. (Muslim: 8/56). Baab: Makhlooq paida honay aur badbakhti aur khushbakhti ke baaray mein."
"1847","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne bayan kiya jabke Aap sachay tasdeeq shuda hain: Beshak tum mein se aik ki khilqat us ki maan ke pait mein chaalees din jama ki jati hai, phir us mein alaqa hota hai usi tarah, phir us mein muzghah hota hai usi tarah. Phir farishta bheja jata hai aur us mein rooh phoonkta hai. Aur usay chaar kalimon ka hukm diya jata hai: Us ke rizq, us ki muddat, us ke amal aur badbakht ya khushbakht honay ka likhna. To us Zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi, beshak tum mein se koi jannatiyon ke amal karta hai yahan tak ke us ke aur us ke darmiyan siwae haath ke kuch nahi hota. To kitab us par sabqat karti hai aur wo dozakhiyon ke amal karta hai aur us mein dakhil hota hai. Aur beshak tum mein se koi dozakhiyon ke amal karta hai yahan tak ke us ke aur us ke darmiyan siwae haath ke kuch nahi hota. To kitab us par sabqat karti hai aur wo jannatiyon ke amal karta hai aur us mein dakhil hota hai. (Muslim: 8/44). (Alaqa se murad jama hua garha khoon hai; muzghah se murad gosht ka tukra hai jitna chabaya jaye.)"
"1848","[AI-translation] Huzaifa bin Usaid se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tak pahunchanay ke sath riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Farishta nutfa par dakhil hota hai jab wo rehem mein thehar jaye chaalees ya paintalees raaton ke baad. To wo kehta hai: Ae mere Rab! Badbakht ya khushbakht? To donon likhay jatay hain. To wo kehta hai: Ae mere Rab! Mard ya aurat? To donon likhay jatay hain. Aur us ka amal, us ka nishan, us ki muddat aur us ka rizq likha jata hai. Phir saheefay lapet diye jatay hain, un mein na zyadati hoti hai na kami. (Muslim: 8/45). (Muslim ki aik riwayat mein gine hue dinon ke siwa hai; doosri riwayat mein ke Tu panah de; alaqa se murad garha khoon hai; muzghah se murad gosht ka tukra hai; pichli hadees mein hai ke ye likhai us waqt hai jab janeen aik sau bees din mein teen marhalon mein badalta hai, phir us mein rooh phoonki jati hai; is hadees mein rawi ka ikhtisar lagta hai; ye hadees aur agli donon makhtooton mein nahi aayeen.)"
"1849","[AI-translation] Amir bin Wasila se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) ko kehtay hue suna: Badbakht wo hai jo apni maan ke pait mein badbakht hua, aur khushbakht wo hai jo doosray se nasihat paye. To wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba mein se aik mard ke paas aaya jinhein Huzaifa bin Usaid Ghifari kaha jata hai. To us ne unhein Ibn Mas'ud ke qaul mein se ye bataya. To us ne kaha: Baghair amal ke aadmi kaisay badbakht hota hai? To us mard ne us se kaha: Kya tum is par taajjub kartay ho? Beshak main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Jab nutfa par biyalees raatein guzarti hain to Allah us ki taraf farishta bhejta hai. To wo us ki soorat banata hai, us ke kaan, us ki aankh, us ki khaal, us ka gosht aur us ki haddiyan banata hai. Phir wo kehta hai: Ae mere Rab! Mard ya aurat? To tumhara Rab jo chahta hai faisla karta hai aur farishta likhta hai. Phir wo kehta hai: Ae mere Rab! Us ki muddat? To kehta hai ke tumhara Rab jo chahta hai aur farishta likhta hai. Phir wo kehta hai: Ae mere Rab! Us ka rizq? To tumhara Rab jo chahta hai faisla karta hai aur farishta likhta hai. Phir farishta saheefa haath mein le kar nikalta hai. To wo us par na zyadati karta hai jo usay hukm diya gaya aur na kami. Aur aik riwayat ke izafay mein hai ke durust ya ghair durust? To Allah usay durust ya ghair durust banata hai. (Muslim: 8/45). Baab: Adam ke betay par zina ka hissa likh diya gaya hai."
"1850","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Adam ke betay par zina mein se us ka hissa likh diya gaya hai jo wo zaroor paye ga. To aankhon ka zina dekhna hai, kaanon ka zina sun-na hai, zuban ka zina kalaam hai, haath ka zina pakarna hai, paon ka zina chalna hai, aur dil khwahish karta hai aur tamanna karta hai, aur sharmgah us ki tasdeeq karti hai ya takzeeb. (Muslim: 8/52). Baab: Allah dilon ko jaisay chahta hai pherta hai."
"1851","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, wo kehtay hain ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Beshak Adam ke beton ke dil sab Rahman ki ungliyon mein se do ungliyon ke darmiyan aik dil ki tarah hain, wo usay jahan chahta hai pherta hai. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae dilon ko phernay walay Allah! Hamaray dilon ko Apni itaat par pher de. (Muslim: 8/51). Baab: Har bacha fitrat par paida hota hai."
"1852","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo kehtay thay: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi bacha nahi magar fitrat par paida hota hai. To us ke maan baap usay Yahudi banatay hain, Nasrani banatay hain aur Majusi banatay hain. Jaisa janwar janwar ko poora paida karta hai, kya tum us mein koi kata pita patay ho? Phir Abu Huraira kehtay thay: Aur agar chaho to padho: Allah ki fitrat jis par Us ne logon ko paida kiya, Allah ki khilqat mein tabdeeli nahi, aayat. (Muslim: 8/52). (Asal fayuktabu zaalika fi batni ummihi tha, Muslim se tasheeh hai; tunjahu se murad janwar ka janwar jan-na hai; jam'a se murad aaza ka poora hona hai.)"
"1853","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mushrikon ke bachon ke baaray mein poocha gaya. Aap ne farmaya: Allah zyada janta hai jo wo kartay jab Us ne unhein paida kiya. (Muslim: 8/54). Baab: Us larkay ke baaray mein jisay Khizr ne qatl kiya."
"1854","[AI-translation] Ubayy bin Ka'b (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak wo larka jisay Khizr ne qatl kiya wo kafir paida kiya gaya tha. Aur agar wo zinda rehta to apne maan baap ko sarkashi aur kufr mein phansa deta. (Muslim: 8/54). Baab: Bachon ka zikr jo mar gaye aur jannatiyon aur dozakhiyon ki paidaish jabke wo apne baapon ki pushton mein thay."
"1855","[AI-translation] Aisha Ummul Momineen (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Ansaar ke bachay ke janazay ki taraf bulaya gaya. To main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Is ke liye khushkhabri hai, jannat ki chidiyon mein se chidiya hai. Us ne burai nahi ki aur na usay paya. Aap ne farmaya: Ya is ke siwa, Ae Aisha! Beshak Allah ne jannat ke liye ghar walay paida kiye, unhein us ke liye paida kiya jabke wo apne baapon ki pushton mein thay. Aur aag ke liye ghar walay paida kiye, unhein us ke liye paida kiya jabke wo apne baapon ki pushton mein thay. (Muslim: 8/55)"
